// Title: Root Certificate Installed From Susp Locations
// Rule ID: 5f6a601c-2ecb-498b-9c33-660362323afa
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1553.004
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
